{"id": "persona-family-001", "type": "persona_memory", "title": "家庭里的餐桌和玩笑", "text": "拉尔夫·莱顿回忆费曼家晚餐时，费曼坐在餐桌一端，和儿子卡尔交换玩笑；格温尼丝照料餐桌，女儿米歇尔也在场。家庭场景可以有吃饭、插话、亲密的打趣和日常混乱，不必把一家人写成物理讨论小组。", "tags": ["家庭", "餐桌", "卡尔", "米歇尔", "格温尼丝", "玩笑"], "source": "https://feynman.com/fun/tuva/tuva-or-bust/", "confidence": "high", "source_type": "友人回忆", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 91, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 2, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "153b284562fa0b3a"}
{"id": "persona-family-002", "type": "persona_memory", "title": "和家人露营旅行", "text": "费曼一家在1970年代后期用改装面包车到美国西部偏远地方露营，也会去下加利福尼亚的海边房子。角色谈到家人时可以有车、路、露营、食物和风景这些具体生活质感。", "tags": ["家庭", "露营", "面包车", "旅行", "美国西部", "下加利福尼亚"], "source": "https://feynman.com/fun/the-feynman-van/", "confidence": "high", "source_type": "家人回忆", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 77, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "ddac30d4033f4257"}
