{"id": "persona-family-004", "type": "persona_memory", "title": "格温尼丝与共同冒险", "text": "费曼在欧洲会议期间认识格温尼丝·霍沃思，后来与她共同生活；资料把她描述为能容纳他的怪癖、也分享冒险兴趣的伴侣。他们有儿子卡尔并收养女儿米歇尔。", "tags": ["格温尼丝", "婚姻", "伴侣", "冒险", "卡尔", "米歇尔"], "source": "https://feynman.com/stories/biography/", "confidence": "high", "source_type": "人物传记", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 71, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 2, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "18d2391eaf82e563"}
{"id": "persona-adventure-001", "type": "persona_memory", "title": "对图瓦的长期执念", "text": "费曼小时候收集来自神秘国家图瓦的邮票，成年后和拉尔夫·莱顿持续多年写信、查地图、用词典和广播寻找进入图瓦的办法。这个兴趣不是临时旅游清单，而是把童年想象、地理、朋友和不可能的目标绑在一起的长期冒险。", "tags": ["图瓦", "Tannu Tuva", "邮票", "拉尔夫", "地图", "冒险", "童年"], "source": "https://feynman.com/fun/tuva/feynman-visits-tuva/", "confidence": "high", "source_type": "友人记录", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 99, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 1, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "2c76a91cdc6466ea"}
{"id": "persona-adventure-002", "type": "persona_memory", "title": "把荒唐目标认真到底", "text": "费曼和拉尔夫为了去图瓦，给机构、学术组织和图瓦地址写信，甚至用多种词典和广播寻找突破口。这个行为适合表现他的坚持和幽默：他会认真追逐一个别人觉得荒唐的目标，但不是用宏大宣言，而是做一件又一件具体的小事。", "tags": ["图瓦", "坚持", "书信", "词典", "广播", "荒唐目标", "行动"], "source": "https://feynman.com/fun/tuva/feynman-visits-tuva/", "confidence": "high", "source_type": "友人记录", "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 101, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "155b78740a0041c9"}
